    },
    "GPU awake" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "GPU-Wachzeit"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "GPU awake"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Éveil du GPU"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "GPU 唤醒时间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Powered and clocked time, not GPU workload. Missing readings are gaps." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zeit mit Stromversorgung und aktivem Takt, nicht die GPU-Auslastung. Fehlende Werte bleiben Lücken."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Powered and clocked time, not GPU workload. Missing readings are gaps."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Temps sous tension avec horloge active, pas la charge GPU. Les mesures manquantes restent des lacunes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "表示 GPU 供电且时钟运行的时间，而非 GPU 负载。缺失读数显示为空缺。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Time the GPU was powered and clocked, including waiting. Click for details." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zeit mit Stromversorgung und aktivem GPU-Takt, einschließlich Wartezeiten. Für Details klicken."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Time the GPU was powered and clocked, including waiting. Click for details."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Temps où le GPU était sous tension avec horloge active, attente comprise. Cliquez pour les détails."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "GPU 供电且时钟运行的时间，包括等待时间。点击查看详情。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Time the GPU was awake, with power and its clock on. It can stay awake while waiting for work. A GPU that is 100% awake may be much less busy. The GPU card shows how busy it was." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zeit, in der die GPU mit Strom und aktivem Takt wach war. Sie kann auch beim Warten auf Arbeit wach bleiben. 100% Wachzeit bedeutet nicht volle Auslastung. Die GPU-Karte zeigt, wie beschäftigt sie war."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Time the GPU was awake, with power and its clock on. It can stay awake while waiting for work. A GPU that is 100% awake may be much less busy. The GPU card shows how busy it was."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Temps où le GPU était éveillé, sous tension et avec son horloge active. Il peut rester éveillé en attendant du travail. Un GPU éveillé à 100% peut être bien moins occupé. La carte GPU indique sa charge."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "GPU 保持唤醒、供电且时钟运行的时间。等待任务时它也可能保持唤醒。唤醒时间为 100% 并不表示始终繁忙。GPU 卡片显示它的实际繁忙程度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS IOReport gives the share of time in the OFF state. We subtract this from 100. If OFF is missing, the value is unknown. The chart uses saved readings. Old logs have no awake-time data." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS IOReport meldet den Zeitanteil im Zustand OFF. Wir ziehen diesen von 100 ab. Fehlt OFF, bleibt der Wert unbekannt. Das Diagramm nutzt gespeicherte Messwerte. Alte Aufzeichnungen enthalten keine Wachzeitdaten."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS IOReport gives the share of time in the OFF state. We subtract this from 100. If OFF is missing, the value is unknown. The chart uses saved readings. Old logs have no awake-time data."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS IOReport fournit la part du temps dans l'état OFF. Nous la soustrayons de 100. Sans état OFF, la valeur reste inconnue. Le graphique utilise les mesures enregistrées. Les anciens relevés ne contiennent pas de données d'éveil."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS IOReport 报告处于 OFF 状态的时间比例。用 100 减去该值即可得到唤醒比例。缺少 OFF 数据时，数值为未知。图表使用已保存的读数。旧记录不包含唤醒时间数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Device utilization shows how much the GPU was busy. Renderer and tiler are parts of its graphics pipeline. GPU awake shows time powered and clocked, including time waiting for work." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Geräteauslastung zeigt, wie beschäftigt die GPU war. Renderer und Tiler sind Teile ihrer Grafikpipeline. GPU-Wachzeit zeigt die Zeit mit Stromversorgung und aktivem Takt, einschließlich Wartezeiten."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Device utilization shows how much the GPU was busy. Renderer and tiler are parts of its graphics pipeline. GPU awake shows time powered and clocked, including time waiting for work."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L'utilisation de l'appareil indique la charge du GPU. Le moteur de rendu et le moteur de tuilage font partie de son pipeline graphique. L'éveil du GPU indique le temps sous tension avec horloge active, attente comprise."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设备利用率表示 GPU 的繁忙程度。渲染器和分块器是图形流水线的组成部分。GPU 唤醒时间表示供电且时钟运行的时间，包括等待任务的时间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GPU clients use the same RAM as the CPU. This is not a separate bank of video memory. Older logs have no GPU memory data." : {
      "comment" : "GPU memory history and bandwidth profile. AI-generated translations need native review.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "GPU-Clients nutzen denselben RAM wie die CPU. Dies ist kein eigener Videospeicher. Ältere Aufzeichnungen enthalten keine GPU-Speicherdaten."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "GPU clients use the same RAM as the CPU. This is not a separate bank of video memory. Older logs have no GPU memory data."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les clients du GPU utilisent la même RAM que le CPU. Il ne s'agit pas d'une mémoire vidéo distincte. Les anciens relevés ne contiennent pas de données sur la mémoire du GPU."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "GPU 客户端与 CPU 共用同一块内存，并没有独立的显存。旧记录不包含 GPU 内存数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
