          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "默认仅启用严重内存压力和进程内存增长警报。所有分析均在您的 Mac 上进行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep swap and process growth in Observations while evaluating the rules. Critical pressure and explicit resource budgets keep their own settings." : {
      "comment" : "Quiet evaluation affects adaptive growth only. AI-generated translations; native-speaker review pending.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Swap- und Prozesswachstum bleiben während der Regelauswertung unter Beobachtungen. Für kritischen Speicherdruck und festgelegte Ressourcenbudgets gelten weiterhin die eigenen Einstellungen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Keep swap and process growth in Observations while evaluating the rules. Critical pressure and explicit resource budgets keep their own settings."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conserve la croissance du swap et des processus dans Observations pendant l’évaluation des règles. La pression critique et les budgets explicites gardent leurs propres réglages."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "评估规则时，将交换空间和进程增长保留在观察项中。严重内存压力及明确设置的资源预算仍遵循各自设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notify for sustained swap growth or heavy swap activity under memory pressure. Stable swap usage alone does not trigger an alert." : {
      "comment" : "Adaptive swap rule explanation. AI-generated translations; native-speaker review pending.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Warnt bei anhaltendem Swap-Wachstum oder starker Swap-Aktivität unter Speicherdruck. Eine stabile Swap-Belegung allein löst keine Warnung aus."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Notify for sustained swap growth or heavy swap activity under memory pressure. Stable swap usage alone does not trigger an alert."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avertit d’une croissance prolongée du swap ou d’une forte activité de swap sous pression mémoire. Une occupation stable du swap ne déclenche pas d’alerte à elle seule."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "交换空间持续增长，或在内存压力下发生大量交换活动时发送通知。仅有稳定的交换空间占用不会触发警报。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watch sustained memory growth quietly. Notify for material, continuing growth or rapid runaway use, not a brief rise or a settled cache." : {
      "comment" : "Conservative process-growth alert explanation. AI-generated translations; native-speaker review pending.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Beobachtet anhaltendes Speicherwachstum still. Warnt bei deutlichem, fortgesetztem oder schnellem unkontrolliertem Wachstum, nicht bei einem kurzen Anstieg oder einem stabilen Cache."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Watch sustained memory growth quietly. Notify for material, continuing growth or rapid runaway use, not a brief rise or a settled cache."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Observe silencieusement la croissance mémoire. Avertit d’une hausse importante et continue ou d’un emballement rapide, pas d’un bref pic ni d’un cache stabilisé."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "静默观察持续内存增长。仅在明显持续增长或快速失控占用时发送通知，而非短暂上升或已稳定的缓存占用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
