    "CPU and GPU die, hottest sensor (whole Mac)" : {
      "comment" : "Identity entries: English renders the key verbatim. Present so the two tables mirror each other and English copy stays auditable in one place; check-localization.py enforces the parity.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "CPU- und GPU-Chip, heißester Sensor (ganzer Mac)"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "CPU and GPU die, hottest sensor (whole Mac)"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puces CPU et GPU, capteur le plus chaud (Mac entier)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "CPU 与 GPU 芯片，最热的传感器（整机）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CPU and GPU temperatures come from separate sensors. A gap means a reading was unavailable, not zero degrees. A high temperature alone does not prove throttling; macOS reports its thermal state separately." : {
      "comment" : "Dashboard chart statistics and investigation details. German, French, and Simplified Chinese translations generated by GitHub Copilot; native-speaker review pending.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "CPU- und GPU-Temperaturen stammen von getrennten Sensoren. Eine Lücke bedeutet, dass kein Messwert verfügbar war, nicht null Grad. Eine hohe Temperatur allein belegt keine Drosselung; macOS meldet seinen thermischen Zustand separat."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "CPU and GPU temperatures come from separate sensors. A gap means a reading was unavailable, not zero degrees. A high temperature alone does not prove throttling; macOS reports its thermal state separately."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les températures CPU et GPU proviennent de capteurs distincts. Une lacune signifie qu’une mesure était indisponible, pas qu’elle valait zéro degré. Une température élevée ne prouve pas à elle seule un bridage ; macOS indique séparément son état thermique."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "CPU 和 GPU 温度来自不同的传感器。空白表示读数不可用，而不是零度。仅凭高温无法确定是否发生降频；macOS 会单独报告热状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CPU cores" : {
