    "CPU die is orange; GPU die is red. A gap means an unavailable sensor reading, not zero. macOS reports thermal state separately; missing data is not treated as nominal." : {
      "comment" : "Dashboard chart statistics and investigation details. German, French, and Simplified Chinese translations generated by GitHub Copilot; native-speaker review pending.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der CPU-Chip ist orange, der GPU-Chip rot. Eine Lücke bedeutet einen fehlenden Sensorwert, nicht null. macOS meldet den thermischen Zustand separat; fehlende Daten gelten nicht als normal."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "CPU die is orange; GPU die is red. A gap means an unavailable sensor reading, not zero. macOS reports thermal state separately; missing data is not treated as nominal."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La puce CPU est en orange, la puce GPU en rouge. Une lacune indique une mesure indisponible, pas zéro. macOS signale séparément l’état thermique ; une donnée manquante n’est pas considérée comme normale."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "CPU 芯片为橙色，GPU 芯片为红色。空白表示传感器读数不可用，而不是零。macOS 单独报告热状态；不会将缺失数据视为正常状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
