    "Compare Now" : {
      "comment" : "Memory Inspector & Open Files",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jetzt vergleichen"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Compare Now"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Comparer maintenant"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "立即对比"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compare busy, user, and system time for each core. Use Top CPU processes to identify the workload. Reopen this sheet for a fresh sample; no historical per-core series is recorded for this view." : {
      "comment" : "Dashboard chart statistics and investigation details. German, French, and Simplified Chinese translations generated by GitHub Copilot; native-speaker review pending.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vergleiche aktive Zeit, Benutzerzeit und Systemzeit pro Kern. Nutze die CPU-intensivsten Prozesse, um die Arbeitslast zu erkennen. Öffne diese Ansicht erneut für einen aktuellen Messwert; sie zeichnet keine historischen Zeitreihen pro Kern auf."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Compare busy, user, and system time for each core. Use Top CPU processes to identify the workload. Reopen this sheet for a fresh sample; no historical per-core series is recorded for this view."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Comparez les temps actif, utilisateur et système de chaque cœur. Identifiez la charge grâce aux principaux processus CPU. Rouvrez cette fenêtre pour un nouvel échantillon ; aucune série historique par cœur n’est enregistrée pour cette vue."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "比较每个核心的繁忙、用户和系统时间。使用 CPU 占用最高的进程来识别工作负载。重新打开此窗口可获取新样本；此视图不记录各核心的历史时间序列。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compare read and write bursts with Top disk processes. Use the Disk tab to inspect device busy time and latency. Caching and delayed writes can shift physical traffic away from the process activity that caused it." : {
      "comment" : "Dashboard chart statistics and investigation details. German, French, and Simplified Chinese translations generated by GitHub Copilot; native-speaker review pending.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vergleiche Lese- und Schreibspitzen mit den datenträgerintensivsten Prozessen. Prüfe im Tab „Datenträger“ die aktive Zeit und Latenz des Geräts. Caches und verzögerte Schreibvorgänge können den physischen Datenverkehr gegenüber der verursachenden Prozessaktivität zeitlich verschieben."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Compare read and write bursts with Top disk processes. Use the Disk tab to inspect device busy time and latency. Caching and delayed writes can shift physical traffic away from the process activity that caused it."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Comparez les pics de lecture et d’écriture aux principaux processus disque. Consultez l’onglet Disque pour examiner le temps d’activité et la latence. Les caches et les écritures différées peuvent décaler le trafic physique par rapport à l’activité du processus qui l’a provoqué."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将读写突发与磁盘活动最高的进程进行比较。在“磁盘”选项卡中检查设备繁忙时间和延迟。缓存和延迟写入可能使物理流量与产生它的进程活动在时间上错开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compare sustained pressure with compressed memory and swap. Use the Processes tab to find large or growing footprints. A short spike is different from pressure that stays high." : {
      "comment" : "Dashboard chart statistics and investigation details. German, French, and Simplified Chinese translations generated by GitHub Copilot; native-speaker review pending.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vergleiche anhaltenden Speicherdruck mit komprimiertem Speicher und Auslagerungsspeicher. Suche im Tab „Prozesse“ nach großem oder wachsendem Speicherbedarf. Eine kurze Spitze ist etwas anderes als dauerhaft hoher Druck."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Compare sustained pressure with compressed memory and swap. Use the Processes tab to find large or growing footprints. A short spike is different from pressure that stays high."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Comparez une pression persistante à la mémoire compressée et à l’échange. Dans l’onglet Processus, recherchez les empreintes mémoire importantes ou croissantes. Un pic bref diffère d’une pression durablement élevée."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将持续内存压力与压缩内存和交换空间进行比较。在“进程”选项卡中查找内存占用较大或不断增长的进程。短暂峰值与持续高压力不同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compare temperatures with CPU activity and macOS thermal state. Check the Energy tab for fans and thermal events. If one sensor is unavailable, do not infer its temperature from the other." : {
      "comment" : "Dashboard chart statistics and investigation details. German, French, and Simplified Chinese translations generated by GitHub Copilot; native-speaker review pending.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vergleiche Temperaturen mit CPU-Aktivität und dem thermischen Zustand von macOS. Prüfe im Tab „Energie“ die Lüfter und thermischen Ereignisse. Ist ein Sensor nicht verfügbar, leite seine Temperatur nicht vom anderen ab."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Compare temperatures with CPU activity and macOS thermal state. Check the Energy tab for fans and thermal events. If one sensor is unavailable, do not infer its temperature from the other."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Comparez les températures à l’activité CPU et à l’état thermique de macOS. Consultez l’onglet Énergie pour les ventilateurs et événements thermiques. Si un capteur est indisponible, ne déduisez pas sa température de l’autre."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将温度与 CPU 活动及 macOS 热状态进行比较。在“能耗”选项卡中查看风扇和热事件。如果一个传感器不可用，不要根据另一个传感器推断其温度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compare the mean with the observed range, then inspect CPU cores and Top CPU processes. Load averages describe queued or running work, not a percentage. Compare them with the machine's core count." : {
      "comment" : "Dashboard chart statistics and investigation details. German, French, and Simplified Chinese translations generated by GitHub Copilot; native-speaker review pending.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vergleiche den Mittelwert mit dem gemessenen Bereich und prüfe dann die CPU-Kerne und CPU-intensivsten Prozesse. Lastmittelwerte beschreiben wartende oder laufende Arbeit, keinen Prozentsatz. Vergleiche sie mit der Kernanzahl des Macs."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Compare the mean with the observed range, then inspect CPU cores and Top CPU processes. Load averages describe queued or running work, not a percentage. Compare them with the machine's core count."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Comparez la moyenne à la plage observée, puis examinez les cœurs et les principaux processus CPU. Les moyennes de charge décrivent le travail en attente ou en cours, pas un pourcentage. Comparez-les au nombre de cœurs de la machine."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先比较平均值和观测范围，再检查 CPU 核心及 CPU 占用最高的进程。平均负载表示排队或正在运行的工作量，而不是百分比。请将其与机器的核心数量比较。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compare the process names with recent copies, builds, downloads, or backups. Use the Disk tab for physical device measurements. Check sample counts; a short observation can be less representative than a long one." : {
      "comment" : "Dashboard chart statistics and investigation details. German, French, and Simplified Chinese translations generated by GitHub Copilot; native-speaker review pending.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vergleiche die Prozessnamen mit kürzlich ausgeführten Kopien, Builds, Downloads oder Backups. Im Tab „Datenträger“ findest du physische Gerätemessungen. Beachte die Anzahl der Messwerte; eine kurze Beobachtung kann weniger aussagekräftig sein als eine lange."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Compare the process names with recent copies, builds, downloads, or backups. Use the Disk tab for physical device measurements. Check sample counts; a short observation can be less representative than a long one."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rapprochez les noms de processus des copies, compilations, téléchargements ou sauvegardes récents. L’onglet Disque fournit les mesures physiques. Vérifiez le nombre d’échantillons ; une observation courte peut être moins représentative qu’une longue."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将进程名称与最近的复制、构建、下载或备份操作对照。在“磁盘”选项卡中查看物理设备测量值。注意样本数量；短时间观察可能不如长时间观察具有代表性。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compare this breakdown with pressure and swap before judging free memory. Check the Processes tab for growing app footprints. Cached files usually need no action because macOS can release that space." : {
      "comment" : "Dashboard chart statistics and investigation details. German, French, and Simplified Chinese translations generated by GitHub Copilot; native-speaker review pending.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vergleiche diese Aufteilung mit Speicherdruck und Auslagerung, bevor du freien Speicher bewertest. Suche im Tab „Prozesse“ nach wachsendem App-Speicherbedarf. Zwischengespeicherte Dateien erfordern meist keine Maßnahme, da macOS den Speicher freigeben kann."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Compare this breakdown with pressure and swap before judging free memory. Check the Processes tab for growing app footprints. Cached files usually need no action because macOS can release that space."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Comparez cette répartition à la pression mémoire et à l’échange avant de juger la mémoire libre. Recherchez les applications dont l’empreinte augmente dans Processus. Les fichiers en cache ne nécessitent généralement aucune action : macOS peut libérer cet espace."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在判断空闲内存之前，将此分布与内存压力和交换空间进行比较。在“进程”选项卡中检查应用内存占用是否增长。缓存文件通常无需处理，因为 macOS 可以释放这部分空间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Comparing with the previous scan…" : {
      "comment" : "Disk Map (1.6.0)",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
