      }
    },
    "Download and upload show the bytes transferred each second across physical network interfaces. They measure traffic, not your connection's maximum speed. The two directions have separate averages and ranges." : {
      "comment" : "Dashboard chart statistics and investigation details. German, French, and Simplified Chinese translations generated by GitHub Copilot; native-speaker review pending.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Download und Upload zeigen die pro Sekunde über physische Netzwerkschnittstellen übertragenen Bytes. Sie messen Datenverkehr, nicht die Höchstgeschwindigkeit der Verbindung. Beide Richtungen haben eigene Mittelwerte und Wertebereiche."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Download and upload show the bytes transferred each second across physical network interfaces. They measure traffic, not your connection's maximum speed. The two directions have separate averages and ranges."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La réception et l’envoi indiquent les octets transférés chaque seconde par les interfaces réseau physiques. Ils mesurent le trafic, pas la vitesse maximale de la connexion. Chaque direction possède sa moyenne et sa plage de valeurs."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下载和上传显示物理网络接口每秒传输的字节数。它们测量流量，而不是连接的最大速度。两个方向分别有各自的平均值和范围。"
