    "From the chip's energy counters (the same source as powermetrics), averaged over each tick. Neural Engine power is the signal that a Core ML model is running: it reads zero when the ANE is idle." : {
      "comment" : "Identity entries: English renders the key verbatim. Present so the two tables mirror each other and English copy stays auditable in one place; check-localization.py enforces the parity.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aus den Energiezählern des Chips (dieselbe Quelle wie powermetrics), gemittelt über jeden Tick. Die Leistungsaufnahme der Neural Engine ist das Signal dafür, dass ein Core ML-Modell läuft: Sie liegt bei null, wenn die ANE inaktiv ist."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "From the chip's energy counters (the same source as powermetrics), averaged over each tick. Neural Engine power is the signal that a Core ML model is running: it reads zero when the ANE is idle."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Issu des compteurs d'énergie de la puce (la même source que powermetrics), moyenné sur chaque intervalle. La puissance du Neural Engine est le signal qu'un modèle Core ML est en cours d'exécution : elle est nulle quand l'ANE est inactif."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "来自芯片的能耗计数器（与 powermetrics 同源），按每个采样周期取平均。Neural Engine 功耗是判断 Core ML 模型是否在跑的信号：ANE 空闲时读数为零。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
