    "Look for sustained growth, then compare pressure, compression, and app memory. Disk activity may increase while memory moves between RAM and swap. A flat swap balance can remain after the workload ends." : {
      "comment" : "Dashboard chart statistics and investigation details. German, French, and Simplified Chinese translations generated by GitHub Copilot; native-speaker review pending.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Achte auf anhaltendes Wachstum und vergleiche Speicherdruck, Komprimierung und App-Speicher. Beim Verschieben zwischen RAM und Auslagerung kann die Datenträgeraktivität steigen. Ein unveränderter Auslagerungsbestand kann nach Ende der Arbeitslast bestehen bleiben."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Look for sustained growth, then compare pressure, compression, and app memory. Disk activity may increase while memory moves between RAM and swap. A flat swap balance can remain after the workload ends."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Recherchez une croissance persistante, puis comparez pression, compression et mémoire des applications. L’activité disque peut augmenter lors des transferts entre RAM et échange. Le volume d’échange peut rester stable après la fin de la charge."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "检查是否持续增长，再比较压力、压缩内存和应用内存。内存在 RAM 与交换空间之间移动时，磁盘活动可能增加。工作负载结束后，交换空间使用量仍可能保持不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
