          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sur adaptateur %@ W"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已接 %@ W 适配器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On Apple silicon, almost no RAM is ever “free”, and that is normal. macOS keeps memory busy on purpose. What matters is memory pressure: how hard the system is working to keep up. %@ puts that front and centre." : {
      "comment" : "OnboardingView",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Auf Apple Silicon ist fast nie RAM „frei“, und das ist normal. macOS hält den Speicher absichtlich beschäftigt. Entscheidend ist der Speicherdruck: wie sehr sich das System anstrengen muss, um mitzuhalten. %@ stellt genau das in den Mittelpunkt."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On Apple silicon, almost no RAM is ever “free”, and that is normal. macOS keeps memory busy on purpose. What matters is memory pressure: how hard the system is working to keep up. %@ puts that front and centre."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sur Apple Silicon, presque aucune RAM n'est jamais « libre », et c'est normal. macOS occupe volontairement la mémoire. Ce qui compte, c'est la pression mémoire : l'effort que fournit le système pour suivre. %@ la met au premier plan."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Apple 芯片上,几乎没有任何内存是真正“空闲”的,这完全正常。macOS 有意让内存保持繁忙。真正重要的是内存压力:系统为跟上需求付出了多大努力。%@ 将这一指标放在最核心的位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On adapter" : {
      "comment" : "Identity entries: English renders the key verbatim. Present so the two tables mirror each other and English copy stays auditable in one place; check-localization.py enforces the parity.",
