          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les 2 dernières heures de pression mémoire, chaque pic étant marqué."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最近 2 小时的内存压力,每次峰值均已标记。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The main thread is blocked in {sample.mainFunction}, not its run loop — the app is frozen." : {
      "comment" : "Identity entries: English renders the key verbatim. Present so the two tables mirror each other and English copy stays auditable in one place; check-localization.py enforces the parity.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Hauptthread hängt in {sample.mainFunction}, nicht in seinem Run Loop: Die App ist eingefroren."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The main thread is blocked in {sample.mainFunction}, not its run loop — the app is frozen."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le thread principal est bloqué dans {sample.mainFunction}, pas dans sa boucle d'exécution : l'app est figée."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主线程阻塞在 {sample.mainFunction}，而不是在它的 run loop 上，应用已经卡死。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The main thread is servicing its run loop — responsive." : {
      "comment" : "Identity entries: English renders the key verbatim. Present so the two tables mirror each other and English copy stays auditable in one place; check-localization.py enforces the parity.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Hauptthread bedient seinen Run Loop: Die App reagiert."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The main thread is servicing its run loop — responsive."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le thread principal traite sa boucle d'exécution : l'app est réactive."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主线程正在处理它的 run loop，响应正常。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The mean uses changes in cumulative attributed read and write bytes across each process's observed portion of the selected range. At least two distinct observation times are needed for a rate. Coverage, caching, and attribution differ from physical device counters. The ranking includes up to 20 recorded processes and refreshes about once a minute." : {
      "comment" : "Dashboard chart statistics and investigation details. German, French, and Simplified Chinese translations generated by GitHub Copilot; native-speaker review pending.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Mittelwert nutzt Änderungen der kumulierten zugeordneten Lese- und Schreibbytes im beobachteten Teil des gewählten Zeitraums je Prozess. Eine Rate benötigt mindestens zwei verschiedene Beobachtungszeitpunkte. Abdeckung, Caching und Zuordnung unterscheiden sich von physischen Gerätezählern. Die Rangliste umfasst bis zu 20 aufgezeichnete Prozesse und wird etwa einmal pro Minute aktualisiert."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The mean uses changes in cumulative attributed read and write bytes across each process's observed portion of the selected range. At least two distinct observation times are needed for a rate. Coverage, caching, and attribution differ from physical device counters. The ranking includes up to 20 recorded processes and refreshes about once a minute."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La moyenne utilise les variations des octets cumulés de lecture et d’écriture attribués pendant la portion observée de chaque processus dans la période sélectionnée. Un débit nécessite au moins deux instants d’observation distincts. La couverture, les caches et l’attribution diffèrent des compteurs physiques. Le classement contient jusqu’à 20 processus enregistrés et s’actualise environ chaque minute."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "平均值根据每个进程在所选时间范围内实际观察时段的累计归因读写字节数变化计算。计算速率至少需要两个不同的观察时间点。覆盖范围、缓存和归因方式与物理设备计数器不同。排名包含最多 20 个已记录进程，约每分钟刷新一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The menu bar read-out is off, so there is nothing to arrange here." : {
