    "Total CPU has averaged %1$@%% over the last %2$@ min. Sustained high CPU is normal during real work, but it warms the machine and drains battery — the top CPU process is the place to look." : {
      "comment" : "Identity entries: English renders the key verbatim. Present so the two tables mirror each other and English copy stays auditable in one place; check-localization.py enforces the parity.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die gesamte CPU-Auslastung lag in den letzten %2$@ Min. im Schnitt bei %1$@ %%. Anhaltend hohe CPU-Last ist bei echter Arbeit normal, erwärmt aber das Gerät und leert die Batterie: Sieh dir zuerst den Prozess mit der höchsten CPU-Last an."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Total CPU has averaged %1$@%% over the last %2$@ min. Sustained high CPU is normal during real work, but it warms the machine and drains battery — the top CPU process is the place to look."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le CPU total a atteint %1$@ %% en moyenne sur les %2$@ dernières minutes. Un CPU élevé et soutenu est normal pendant un vrai travail, mais il chauffe la machine et vide la batterie : commencez par le processus le plus gourmand en CPU."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "过去 %2$@ 分钟内 CPU 平均占用 %1$@%%。持续高 CPU 占用在真正干活时是正常的，但会让机器发热、耗电，先看看占用最高的进程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Total CPU has stayed above %@%% for a sustained period. If this is unexpected, the top CPU process is the place to look." : {
      "comment" : "Identity entries: English renders the key verbatim. Present so the two tables mirror each other and English copy stays auditable in one place; check-localization.py enforces the parity.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die gesamte CPU-Auslastung liegt seit längerer Zeit über %@ %%. Falls das unerwartet ist, sieh dir zuerst den Prozess mit der höchsten CPU-Last an."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Total CPU has stayed above %@%% for a sustained period. If this is unexpected, the top CPU process is the place to look."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le CPU total est resté au-dessus de %@ %% pendant une période prolongée. Si c'est inattendu, commencez par le processus le plus gourmand en CPU."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "CPU 总占用已持续高于 %@%%。如果这不在预期内，先看占用最高的那个进程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Total CPU is the share of all cores in use, 0-100%. Per-process CPU (in the list and menubar) follows Activity Monitor: percent of one core, so a busy multi-threaded app can exceed 100%." : {
      "comment" : "DashboardView",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gesamt-CPU ist der Anteil aller genutzten Kerne, 0-100 %. Die CPU pro Prozess (in der Liste und in der Menüleiste) folgt der Aktivitätsanzeige: Prozent eines Kerns, sodass eine ausgelastete Multithread-App über 100 % kommen kann."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Total CPU is the share of all cores in use, 0-100%. Per-process CPU (in the list and menubar) follows Activity Monitor: percent of one core, so a busy multi-threaded app can exceed 100%."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le CPU total est la part de tous les cœurs en usage, de 0 à 100 %. Le CPU par processus (dans la liste et la barre des menus) suit Moniteur d'activité : pourcentage d'un seul cœur, si bien qu'une app multithread très active peut dépasser 100 %."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "总 CPU 是所有核心的使用比例,范围 0-100%。按进程统计的 CPU(在列表和菜单栏中)与活动监视器一致,按单个核心的百分比计算,因此繁忙的多线程应用可能超过 100%。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Total CPU is the share of all logical cores in use, from 0 to 100%. High use can be healthy during demanding work. A narrow range means steady demand; a wide range means bursts." : {
      "comment" : "Dashboard chart statistics and investigation details. German, French, and Simplified Chinese translations generated by GitHub Copilot; native-speaker review pending.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gesamt-CPU ist der genutzte Anteil aller logischen Kerne von 0 bis 100%. Bei anspruchsvoller Arbeit kann hohe Auslastung normal sein. Ein schmaler Bereich bedeutet gleichmäßigen Bedarf, ein breiter Bereich Lastspitzen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Total CPU is the share of all logical cores in use, from 0 to 100%. High use can be healthy during demanding work. A narrow range means steady demand; a wide range means bursts."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le CPU total est la part utilisée de tous les cœurs logiques, de 0 à 100%. Une forte utilisation peut être normale pour un travail exigeant. Une plage étroite indique une demande stable ; une plage large, des pics."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "总 CPU 使用率是所有逻辑核心已使用的比例，范围为 0 到 100%。处理高负载任务时，高使用率可能是正常的。范围窄表示需求稳定，范围宽表示存在突发。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
