            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您可以随时切换：在设置中或从菜单栏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're near the %@-sample limit above which the app slows down, so retention is capped at what fits. To keep more history, choose a coarser frequency." : {
      "comment" : "SettingsView",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du bist nahe an der Grenze von %@ Samples, ab der die App langsamer wird, daher ist die Aufbewahrung auf das begrenzt, was hineinpasst. Um mehr Verlauf zu behalten, wähle eine gröbere Frequenz."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You're near the %@-sample limit above which the app slows down, so retention is capped at what fits. To keep more history, choose a coarser frequency."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vous approchez de la limite de %@ échantillons au-delà de laquelle l'app ralentit, donc la rétention est plafonnée à ce qui tient. Pour conserver plus d'historique, choisissez une fréquence plus espacée."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您已接近 %@ 个样本的上限,超过此上限应用会变慢,因此保留时间受限于所能容纳的量。若要保留更多历史记录,请选择较粗的频率。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Mac has been working hard" : {
      "comment" : "Identity entries: English renders the key verbatim. Present so the two tables mirror each other and English copy stays auditable in one place; check-localization.py enforces the parity.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Mac hat hart gearbeitet"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your Mac has been working hard"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Votre Mac a beaucoup travaillé"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的 Mac 一直在高负荷运行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Mac has moved an average of %1$@ over the last %2$@ min, peaking at %3$@. That usually means an ongoing download, upload, sync, or backup." : {
      "comment" : "Identity entries: English renders the key verbatim. Present so the two tables mirror each other and English copy stays auditable in one place; check-localization.py enforces the parity.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Mac hat in den letzten %2$@ Min. durchschnittlich %1$@ übertragen, mit einer Spitze von %3$@. Das bedeutet meist einen laufenden Download, Upload, eine Synchronisierung oder ein Backup."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your Mac has moved an average of %1$@ over the last %2$@ min, peaking at %3$@. That usually means an ongoing download, upload, sync, or backup."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Votre Mac a transféré en moyenne %1$@ sur les %2$@ dernières minutes, avec un pic à %3$@. Cela indique généralement un téléchargement, un envoi, une synchronisation ou une sauvegarde en cours."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "过去 %2$@ 分钟内，你的 Mac 平均传输 %1$@，峰值 %3$@。这通常意味着正在下载、上传、同步或备份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Mac is moving memory to disk to cope. Consider quitting %@, the largest consumer." : {
      "comment" : "Identity entries: English renders the key verbatim. Present so the two tables mirror each other and English copy stays auditable in one place; check-localization.py enforces the parity.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Mac lagert Speicher auf die Festplatte aus, um zurechtzukommen. Erwäge, %@ zu beenden, den größten Verbraucher."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your Mac is moving memory to disk to cope. Consider quitting %@, the largest consumer."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Votre Mac déplace de la mémoire vers le disque pour tenir. Envisagez de quitter %@, le plus gros consommateur."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的 Mac 正在把内存换出到磁盘来应付。可以考虑退出占用最多的 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Mac is under heavy memory pressure and is compressing and swapping to cope. Closing a few large apps will give it room." : {
      "comment" : "Identity entries: English renders the key verbatim. Present so the two tables mirror each other and English copy stays auditable in one place; check-localization.py enforces the parity.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Mac steht unter starkem Speicherdruck und komprimiert und swappt, um zurechtzukommen. Ein paar große Apps zu schließen verschafft ihm Luft."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your Mac is under heavy memory pressure and is compressing and swapping to cope. Closing a few large apps will give it room."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Votre Mac subit une forte pression mémoire et compresse et swappe pour tenir. Fermer quelques grosses apps lui donnera de l'air."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的 Mac 内存压力很大，正在通过压缩和 Swap 来应付。关掉几个大应用可以腾出空间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
